<title>SINGAPORE: Aztech plans 36 mln new share placement.</title>
<headline>Aztech plans 36 mln new share placement.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multimedia company Aztech Systems Ltd asked for trade in its shares to be suspended by the Stock Exchange of Singapore on Wednesday afternoon pending the announcement of plans for a private placement of 36 million new ordinary shares at 59.5 cents each, state television said.</p>
<p>The report said Aztech planned to raise some Singapore $20 million which would be used to repay bank borrowings.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
